       | leaf-CBZ2-12H-b-1 | leaf-LEASPh4-a-1 | leaf-LDBs6-a-1 | leaf-BR1-7-a-1 | leaf-CB3R24H-c-1 | leaf-CBI6-8H-c-1 | leaf-CBI5-10H-a-1
