       | leaf-CBI3-10-a-1 | leaf-LDS12H-b-1 | leaf-CMPC16H-a-1 | leaf-STX6H-a-1 | leaf-LDBs10-a-1 | leaf-SOBs12-a-1 | leaf-SOBs12-a-2
